+# Async Runtime
+
+This project's recorded decision is to use tokio as the async runtime, adopted for its ecosystem support and confirmed in `config/decisions/revoke-async-runtime.json` (value `"tokio"`); that config file was later removed from the tree, but no subsequent decision has changed the recorded value, so tokio remains the current decision.
